      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسَدَّسٌ</span></b>  A thing <i>composed of six layers</i> or
<i>strata,</i> or <i>of six distinct fascicles</i> or <i>the like.</i>
(TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثلث</span>. [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسْدُوسٌ</span>, below.])
― 
